abstract: "Reproducibility package for the doctoral thesis Lifecycle-Aware Database Cybersecurity: A Triple-Loop Learning Approach. The package contains dataset manifests, evaluation scripts, generated results, audit summaries, metric registers, and controlled SQL train, validation, and test partitions used to support the reported AI-DAC evaluation."
